# Observability Patterns for BookClub

## Metrics to Track
Based on MVP requirements, implement these metrics:
- `bookclub_requests_total` - HTTP request counter
- `bookclub_ingestion_duration_seconds` - PDF processing time
- `bookclub_chunks_processed_total` - Number of chunks created
- `bookclub_cards_generated_total` - Flashcards generated
- `bookclub_llm_api_calls_total` - LLM API usage

## Logging Structure
Use structured JSON logging with these fields:
- `trace_id` - Request correlation
- `span_id` - Operation correlation  
- `user_id` - User context (if applicable)
- `operation` - Operation type (ingest, generate, review)
- `document_id` - PDF identifier
- `chunk_count` - Number of chunks processed
- `card_count` - Number of cards generated

## Grafana Dashboard Context
- Reference [observability/](mdc:observability/) for dashboard configs
- Use consistent metric naming for dashboard queries
- Include both technical and business metrics
- Set up alerts for critical failures

## Error Handling
- Log all LLM API errors with retry counts
- Track PDF parsing failures separately
- Monitor Qdrant connection issues
- Alert on high error rates